  "description": "Upgrade your ride with OEDRO Running Boards—where rugged durability meets sleek style. Designed for effortless access, they make getting in and out of your pickup while shielding your vehicle from road debris. With a bold, off-road-ready look and precision-built toughness, these running boards enhance safety, style, and convenience. Built to last and easy to maintain, they're the perfect upgrade for both adventurers and daily drivers.\nFeatures\nEnhanced Accessibility: Perfect for kids, seniors, and passengers with limited mobility, these running boards provide a secure, comfortable step—especially for lifted vehicles.\nKeeps Your Interior Clean: The textured surface helps remove dirt, mud, and snow from shoes, keeping your vehicle’s interior spotless.\nProtects Your Paintwork: Shields side panels from chips and scratches caused by rocks and road debris, preserving your vehicle's exterior.\nConvenient Double Convex Design: Double Convex steps offer easier access to lifted vehicles, roof racks, and cargo—perfect for any adventure.\nDurable & Non-Slip: Crafted from precision-cut steel with a powder-coated, anti-slip surface for reliable grip in all weather conditions. Easy to clean and built to last.\n1-Year Warranty | Professional installation is highly recommended for safety.\nFitment\nCompatible with 2019–2026 RAM 1500 New Body Crew Cab.",
